{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/sweetlow' data-target='computer\/program\/sweetlow' data-title='SweetLow'>\r\n\t\t\tSweetLow\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"* Follow all steps in sequence.","label":"Steps","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/sweetlow\/details","label":"Details","url":"\/computer\/program\/sweetlow\/details"},"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Follow all steps in sequence.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<h2>1. Install filter driver<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Setup.exe<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>Default.<\/strong> \u2018Mice only`.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>check <code class='inline'>Filter On Device<\/code><\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tA. Downclock to verify (say 62).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>Install service<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>Restart<\/code> (option in app).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>2. Atsiv - execute patch driver<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>C:\\Programs\\Atsiv\\Atsiv.exe -f C:\\Programs\\Atsiv\\hidusbfp.sys<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tWill say failed - which is fine.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>3. restart<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>C:\\Programs\\Atsiv\\devcon restart *VID_046D*<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tOr you could use setup.exe - \u2018restart\u2019.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>verify.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttps:\/\/zowie.benq.com\/en\/support\/mouse-rate-checker.html\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIn case of failure (later on) - uninstall mouse driver (from device manager).\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/sweetlow\/steps\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/sweetlow\/steps\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/sweetlow\/details' data-target='computer\/program\/sweetlow\/details' data-title='Details' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Details<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/program\/sweetlow' data-target='computer\/program\/sweetlow' data-title='SweetLow'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>SweetLow<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}